-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822883_1487801959316404_5717692708207696641_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cY-o6a2Br7YQ7kNvwE7FBLh&_nc_oc=AdqD5GHwxfXvhonG3USIapDRFiaOQ0Uau9VRIU-5W-8BR0-2zm1o6JLiXi1A5xkcRqs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSMIDv5MZxJAXnn2x1uTYU3QY-VxtPY593gNlHvN5rJMg&oe=6B01EE86"}, "display_name": "RogueGods Demo", "keywords": ["TCG", "cards", "deckbuilder", "strategy", "roguelike"], "long_description": "# FREE DEMO OF ROGUEGODS: ACT I\n\n\ud83d\udd25 **The full game is out December 3. Pre-order it now with a limited-time discount:** https://www.meta.com/experiences/23922241070805612/\n\nHades has opened a rift atop Olympus and imprisoned its gods. Now the creatures of the Underworld pour down toward the human world. Climb the first act and prove you are worthy.\n\n\ud83c\udfc6 Finalist: Best Indie Game (IRIS Games Awards 2026) and Best Indie VR Game (Pucela Game Awards 2025)\n\n# What's in the demo\n- The complete Act I: procedural map, shops, forges, mythic events, elites and a boss\n{632847616218480}\n- Two heroes with their own decks: Heracles (axe and shield, up close) and Hippolyta (bow and poison, from afar)\n{1415126163124006}\n- Cards that become real in your hands and rings that change your build\n{1106163998270701}\n{620687614448547}\n- Play with controllers or hand tracking\n- Play in VR, or in mixed reality on Quest 3 and 3S\n{4189033177999902}\n\n# What the full game adds\n- Acts II and III, a final boss\u2026 and a secret ending\n- Theseus and a secret fourth hero\n- 306 cards, 120 rings, 88 creatures from Greek myth\n- Daily challenge, bestiary and Ascension mode\n\nUnlocked cards are kept between runs.\n\n\ud83d\udcac Discord: discord.com/invite/EHMGuTesvK", "short_description": "FREE DEMO: play Act I of RogueGods with two heroes, Heracles and Hippolyta. A deckbuilder roguelite for VR and mixed reality where every card becomes real in your hands: an axe to swing, a bow to draw, an orb to throw, a creature to summon. The full game is out December 3 with Acts II and III, Theseus and a secret fourth hero, 306 cards, 120 rings and 88 creatures. Pre-order it now: search RogueGods in the Store. Finalist, Best Indie Game, IRIS Games Awards 2026."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://katarsigames.com/privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Katarsi Games", "support_website_url": "https://katarsigames.com/contact.html", "website_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@KatarsiGames", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2710427532541308"}, {"id": "3744040075834813"}, {"id": "1676485315806614"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "275629210202852"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "es", "es_MX"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH", "HAND_TRACKING"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "28542895398707127"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823910_993714863137555_6075935672098394571_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Y-4h_lnJtskQ7kNvwHG3SK_&_nc_oc=AdrzSN0AuUfBZIhpt9uudOJjGRzVKvk_hHc6BTf4iYLp94yoKNLLYDVmxTpfc2pZqr4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTwrkTec9hgiImWjysweJC73-3YrNoQglazreV_4LTV9g&oe=6B01DD74"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "RogueG