dn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820891_993589022627935_8995174889535897462_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XwMtrRS8M0UQ7kNvwEHNONn&_nc_oc=AdrX_Ttm9dxvy5ZWcfufaebkFRxYtNvkJk8rIfCoECAuzNbyNQ3hEue70KX0NCCQfLw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRIPzpJufZojw5qWuHeIoQ2HombZs-6U_LXW94_7TrkYg&oe=6B01DB9F"}, {"file_name": "rg4ZZ.png", "id": "1269736414511182", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819315_1269736417844515_273496829688142764_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=u0FWvpOPsQ4Q7kNvwHoLj4d&_nc_oc=AdrfNH1jBw1IOqLyNsgGm45jH_bOAkv8bdB4KKqk6sajUA-Ldcu6PzpqMl6z-172Ylc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTJGF7y5o8Hp3Y5QH5NxulSdavEY3QLxuIBTGUzj72E8A&oe=6B01B8C6"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "RogueGods", "keywords": ["Deckbuilding", "Roguelike", "Strategy", "TCG", "Mythology"], "long_description": "Rogue Gods redefines card-based strategy games with the power of virtual and mixed reality. Step into a stunning world inspired by Greek mythology, where every card you play shapes your destiny.\n\nKey Features:\n\n- Immersive Deck-Building: Craft your deck from over 300 unique cards. Play attacks, cast spells, or summon mythical allies in thrilling turn-based battles.\n- Greek Legends Come to Life: Choose your hero\u2014Heracles, Hippolyta, or Theseus\u2014each with unique skills. Face legendary creatures like Cyclops, Hydra, and Medusa.\n- Ever-Changing Adventures: Procedurally generated maps ensure no two runs are the same. Adapt your strategy to new challenges every time.\n- XR Combat at Its Best: Play cards, wield mythical weapons, and dodge enemy strikes with intuitive hands-on controls.\n- Endless Replayability: Unlock new cards, magical rings, and modes with every run, creating limitless strategies.\n\nSave Olympus from Hades\u2019 forces in this groundbreaking fusion of strategy and XR immersion. Will you rise as the hero of legend?", "short_description": "Immerse yourself in Rogue Gods, the first true card-based strategy game built for VR and mixed reality. Combine tactical deck-building with intuitive, hands-on combat as you battle mythical creatures in a world inspired by Greek legends. Wield over 300 unique powers, explore procedurally generated maps, and forge your path to Olympus in this groundbreaking turn-based adventure. Experience strategy redefined\u2014only in Rogue Gods."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "644826194606121", "locale": "es_LA", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "RogueGods", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Rogue Gods redefine los juegos de estrategia con cartas gracias al poder de la realidad virtual y mixta. Entra en un mundo asombroso inspirado en la mitolog\u00eda griega, donde cada carta que juegas forja tu destino.\n\nCaracter\u00edsticas principales:\nConstrucci\u00f3n de mazos inmersiva:\nCrea tu mazo con m\u00e1s de 300 cartas \u00fanicas. Lanza ataques, conjura hechizos o invoca aliados m\u00edticos en emocionantes combates por turnos.\n\nLeyendas griegas hechas realidad:\nElige tu h\u00e9roe\u2014Heracles, Hip\u00f3lita o Teseo\u2014cada uno con habilidades \u00fanicas. Enfr\u00e9ntate a criaturas legendarias como el C\u00edclope, la Hidra o Medusa.\n\nAventuras siempre diferentes:\nLos mapas generados proceduralmente garantizan que cada partida sea \u00fanica. Adapta tu estrategia a nuevos retos cada vez que juegues.\n\nCombate XR total:\nJuega cartas, blande armas m\u00edticas y esquiva ataques enemigos con controles intuitivos y totalmente f\u00edsicos.\n\nRejugabilidad infinita:\nDesbloquea nuevas cartas, anillos m\u00e1gicos y modos de juego con cada partida, creando combinaciones y estrategias ilimitadas.\n\nSalva el Olimpo de las fuerzas de Hades en esta innovadora fusi\u00f3n de estrategia y realidad virtual.\n\u00bfEst\u00e1s listo para convertirte en el h\u00e9roe de la leyenda?", "short_description": "Sum\u00e9rgete en Rogue Gods, el primer juego de estrategia con cartas realmente creado para VR y Realidad Mixta. Combina construcci\u00f3n t\u00e1ctica de mazos con combate intuitivo y f\u00edsico mientras te enfrentas a criaturas m\u00edticas en un mundo inspirado en las leyendas griegas. Domina m\u00e1s de 300 poderes \u00fanicos, explora mapas generados proceduralmente y forja tu propio camino hacia el Olimpo en esta aventura por turnos sin precedentes.\nDescubre la estrategia redefinida\u2014solo en Rogue Gods.\n\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://katarsigames.com/privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Katarsi Games", "support_website_url": "https://katarsigames.com/contact.html", "website_url": "https://roguegods.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1676485315806614"}, {"id": "821934236779161"}, {"id": "275629210202852"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "es", "es_MX"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH", "GAMEPAD"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "7812623522160951"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1043029631258510"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1043029631258510"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1757010780, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1043029631258510"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typen